ui.wati_codex.welcome_title=Welcome to WATI Codex
ui.wati_codex.welcome_intro=This Codex can accompany you in three different ways. Choose how you want to consult and preserve the knowledge of this world. You can change your choice later unless an operator sets a server policy.
ui.wati_codex.welcome_forced=The operators of this world selected this mode for every player.
ui.wati_codex.continue=Continue
