ui.wati_codex.server_policy=Server policy
ui.wati_codex.mode_forced_note=This mode was established by the server operators.
ui.wati_codex.mode.knowledge=Knowledge Codex
ui.wati_codex.mode.knowledge.short=Freely consult all registered information.
ui.wati_codex.mode.knowledge.description=Shows all content, recipes, uses, provenance, and acquisition methods known by WATI Core from the beginning.
ui.wati_codex.mode.exploration=Knowledge and Exploration
ui.wati_codex.mode.exploration.short=Consult the catalog and document biomes, ecosystems and routes.
ui.wati_codex.mode.exploration.description=Keeps the complete catalog available while recording visited biomes, recognizable ecosystems and recent routes.
ui.wati_codex.mode.adventure=Your Adventure Record
ui.wati_codex.mode.adventure.short=Turn knowledge into progression and discoveries.
ui.wati_codex.mode.adventure.description=The Codex begins with limited knowledge. Objects, blocks, entities, biomes and ecosystems are documented through your actions and travels.
ui.wati_codex.home_intro.knowledge=Freely investigate installed content, discover where it is crafted, and review what it is used for.
ui.wati_codex.home_intro.exploration=Consult the complete add-on catalog while documenting the route followed by the explorers of this world.
ui.wati_codex.home_intro.adventure=The Codex pages are written as you obtain items, study blocks, and encounter entities during your adventures. You can only consult what you have already documented.
ui.wati_codex.profile_settings=Profile and settings
ui.wati_codex.settings_intro=Select the experience you want to use. Changing modes will never delete discoveries, routes, or future data.
ui.wati_codex.settings_forced=Your personal choice is preserved, but it cannot be applied while the server maintains a mandatory mode.
ui.wati_codex.policy.player_choice=Allow personal choice
ui.wati_codex.policy.player_choice.short=Each player chooses their own mode when opening the Codex.
ui.wati_codex.admin_title=WATI Codex administration
ui.wati_codex.admin_intro=Set which mode this world will use. Only an operator can open this menu, and it does not require cheats to be enabled.
ui.wati_codex.admin_no_delete=Changing the policy does not delete profiles or progress. The new selection applies when each player opens their Codex again.
ui.wati_codex.admin_saved_title=Policy saved
ui.wati_codex.admin_saved=The server policy was updated successfully.
ui.wati_codex.admin_applies_next_open=Players will receive this configuration the next time they open WATI Codex.

